    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "For years, the platform promoting its own services has been the hypocrite claiming fairness while stacking the deck. Now, the gatekeeper enforcers have finalized a penalty in the high hundreds of millions of euros under the new rulebook for digital gatekeepers. This financial penalty, due before the Commission's August recess, is the next chapter in a decade of regulatory slapstick for the parent puppet master.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Jester",
        "fragments": [
