    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The forgotten extras in the search circus are about to see some justice. Under the red tape of Brussels, the slow-motion comedy of due process has concluded. The bureaucrats are polishing the penalty hammer for the repeat offender on a decade-long fine binge. A formal decision is expected soon, and the price of getting caught in the act will be the grand finale scheduled before the holidays.",
